    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14243" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόφορ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not to be borne</i> or
				<i>suffered,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μίασμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phalar.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					141
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπότροπον</span> Ruhnk.).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>past bearing,</i>
			
